.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg></span><span class="bs-bold-trust-label">Top-Rated Locally</span></div><div class="bs-bold-trust-card"><span class="bs-bold-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg></span><span class="bs-bold-trust-label">On-Time Guarantee</span></div><div class="bs-bold-trust-card"><span class="bs-bold-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10v12"></path><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path></svg></span><span class="bs-bold-trust-label">Upfront Pricing</span></div></div></div><section class="bs-section bs-section-alt bs-reveal" id="services"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-section-head"><p class="bs-section-eyebrow">Full-Service Painting</p><h2 class="bs-section-title">Why Choose KARKENS?</h2><p class="bs-section-intro">Whether you’re refreshing one room or giving your entire home a new look, we’re here to make the process simple, professional, and enjoyable.</p></div><div class="bs-services-bold"><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-house" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"></path><path d="M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Interior Painting</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">We transform living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, and more with smooth, even coats and clean edge work with minimal disruption, maximum impact.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sun" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Exterior Painting</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">Our exterior painting process includes thorough surface prep and premium weather-resistant paints that stand up to Arizona&#x27;s intense sun.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-menu" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 8h10"></path><path d="M7 12h10"></path><path d="M7 16h10"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Cabinet Refinishing</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">Give your kitchen or bathroom cabinets a fresh lease on life with professional-grade refinishing that&#x27;s far more affordable than a full replacement.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-armchair" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 9V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3"></path><path d="M3 16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-9a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V11a2 2 0 0 0-4 0z"></path><path d="M5 18v2"></path><path d="M19 18v2"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Furniture Painting</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">We apply protective stains and sealers to furniture, preserving the wood and enhancing its natural look season after season.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-door-closed" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 20V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14"></path><path d="M2 20h20"></path><path d="M14 12v.01"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Door Painting</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">Breath new life into worn out and peeling paint on any door. We specialize in making old look brand new making your home look amazing.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-paint-bucket" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m19 11-8-8-8.6 8.6a2 2 0 0 0 0 2.8l5.2 5.2c.8.8 2 .8 2.8 0L19 11Z"></path><path d="m5 2 5 5"></path><path d="M2 13h15"></path><path d="M22 20a2 2 0 1 1-4 0c0-1.6 1.7-2.4 2-4 .3 1.6 2 2.4 2 4Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Drywall Repairs</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">Have holes that need patch and paint or new sections added. Our team has the skills to repair any drywall issue you might have.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-car" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2"></path><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"></circle><path d="M9 17h6"></path><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Garage Painting</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">We handle surface prep before we paint, so every garage door is smooth and ready for a lasting professional looking finish.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-columns4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7.5 3v18"></path><path d="M12 3v18"></path><path d="M16.5 3v18"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">Gate Painting</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">Don&#x27;t let the Arizona sun keep your gate looking damaged. Our expert team will bring life back to sun-bleached wood or protect your iron with the best materials for lasting results.</p></div><div class="bs-card bs-services-bold-card"><div class="bs-icon-box bs-icon-box--lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bs-services-bold-title"><a href="#contact" class="bs-link">and More!</a></h3><p class="bs-services-bold-desc">If you don&#x27;t see it on our site, ask us and our friendly staff will get back to you ASAP. We love our work and want you to love it too.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bs-section bs-reveal" id="about"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-about-grid bs-about-grid--bold"><div><p class="bs-section-eyebrow">Family Owned</p><h2 class="bs-section-title">San Tan Valley&#x27;s Painting Specialists</h2><p class="bs-about-body">When you choose KARKENS, you’re choosing a local family who genuinely cares about the work we do and the people we serve.</p><a href="#contact" class="bs-btn bs-btn-primary bs-about-cta">Get a Free Quote<svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="bs-cta-arrow"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="bs-about-image-wrap"><img alt="San Tan Valley&#x27;s Painting Specialists" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2F9bec3169fb0ac2e35b93626ea2a167001301b9d4-640x480.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></section><section class="bs-stats-band bs-reveal" aria-label="By the numbers"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-stats-band-grid"><div class="bs-stats-band-item"><span class="bs-stat-value bs-stats-band-value">2+</span><span class="bs-stats-band-label">Years in the area</span></div><div class="bs-stats-band-item"><span class="bs-stat-value bs-stats-band-value">200+</span><span class="bs-stats-band-label">Homes painted</span></div></div></div></section><section class="bs-section bs-reveal" id="pricing"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-section-head"><h2 class="bs-section-title">Specials</h2><p class="bs-section-intro">Quotes are always free - Limited Discount offer!</p></div><div class="bs-pricing-grid"><div class="bs-price-card bs-price-card--featured"><span class="bs-price-badge">Best Value</span><h3 class="bs-price-name">Exterior Painting</h3><div class="bs-price-amount"><span class="amt">30% Off</span><span class="unit">your project</span></div><p class="bs-price-desc">Limited time discount</p><a href="#contact" class="bs-btn bs-btn-primary">Request your quote</a></div><div class="bs-price-card"><h3 class="bs-price-name">Interior Painting</h3><div class="bs-price-amount"><span class="amt">20% Off</span><span class="unit">your project</span></div><p class="bs-price-desc">Limited time discount</p><a href="#contact" class="bs-btn bs-btn-outline">Request your quote</a></div></div></div></section><section class="bs-section bs-reveal" id="faq"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-section-head bs-faq-head"><p class="bs-section-eyebrow">SO MANY REASONS TO CHOSE KARKENS</p><h2 class="bs-section-title">Why Choose KARKENS?</h2></div><div class="bs-faq-list"><details class="bs-faq-item" open=""><summary class="bs-faq-q"><span class="bs-faq-q-text">Family Owned</span><span class="bs-faq-marker" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="bs-faq-a"><p>When you choose KARKENS, you’re choosing a local family who genuinely cares about the work we do and the people we serve.</p></div></details><details class="bs-faq-item" open=""><summary class="bs-faq-q"><span class="bs-faq-q-text">Quality You Can See</span><span class="bs-faq-marker" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="bs-faq-a"><p>We take pride in the details. From preparation to the final coat, we work carefully to deliver a clean, professional finish.</p></div></details><details class="bs-faq-item" open=""><summary class="bs-faq-q"><span class="bs-faq-q-text">Honest &amp; Transparent</span><span class="bs-faq-marker" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="bs-faq-a"><p>We believe you deserve to know exactly what you’re getting. We communicate clearly, provide straightforward service, and treat your home with respect.</p></div></details><details class="bs-faq-item" open=""><summary class="bs-faq-q"><span class="bs-faq-q-text">Reliable &amp; Efficient</span><span class="bs-faq-marker" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="bs-faq-a"><p>We show up when we say we will, work efficiently, and take pride in completing your project with care.</p></div></details></div></div></section><section class="bs-section bs-section-alt bs-reveal" id="how-it-works"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-section-head"><p class="bs-section-eyebrow">Simple Steps</p><h2 class="bs-section-title">How It Works</h2></div><div class="bs-process-timeline"><div class="bs-process-timeline-item"><div class="bs-process-timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bs-step-num"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-list" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M12 11h4"></path><path d="M12 16h4"></path><path d="M8 11h.01"></path><path d="M8 16h.01"></path></svg></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-connector"></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-content"><h3 class="bs-process-step-title">Request Your Quote</h3><p class="bs-process-step-desc">Reach out online or by phone and we&#x27;ll schedule a convenient time to assess your project and provide a detailed, no-obligation estimate.</p></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-item"><div class="bs-process-timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bs-step-num"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-connector"></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-content"><h3 class="bs-process-step-title">Choose Your Colors</h3><p class="bs-process-step-desc">We&#x27;ll help you select the right paints and finishes for your home&#x27;s style, lighting, and the demands of the Arizona environment.</p></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-item"><div class="bs-process-timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bs-step-num"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-paint-roller" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="6" x="2" y="2" rx="2"></rect><path d="M10 16v-2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><rect width="4" height="6" x="8" y="16" rx="1"></rect></svg></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-connector"></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-content"><h3 class="bs-process-step-title">We Get to Work</h3><p class="bs-process-step-desc">Our crew arrives on time, preps all surfaces thoroughly, and applies every coat with care — keeping your home clean and protected throughout.</p></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-item"><div class="bs-process-timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bs-step-num"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="bs-process-timeline-content"><h3 class="bs-process-step-title">Final Walkthrough</h3><p class="bs-process-step-desc">Before we pack up, we do a full walkthrough with you to confirm every detail meets your expectations — we&#x27;re not done until you&#x27;re thrilled.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bs-section bs-reveal" id="about"><div class="bs-container"><div class="bs-about-grid bs-about-grid--bold"><div><p class="bs-section-eyebrow">Your Home. Your Vision. Our Craft.</p><h2 class="bs-section-title">Your home is personal, and welcoming someone into it is a big deal. That’s why we focus on building trust not just painting walls.</h2><p class="bs-about-body">From the first conversation to the final walkthrough, KARKENS Painting Company is committed to making your experience smooth, transparent, and stress free.</p><a href="#contact" class="bs-btn bs-btn-primary bs-about-cta">I&#x27;m ready to give my space a fresh look<svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="bs-cta-arrow"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="bs-about-image-wrap"><img alt="karkens painting logo black" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2Fce57bd4cba8930dc71c0bb43cbe98c25c0a652b2-952x640.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2Fce57bd4cba8930dc71c0bb43cbe98c25c0a652b2-952x640.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2Fce57bd4cba8930dc71c0bb43cbe98c25c0a652b2-952x640.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2Fce57bd4cba8930dc71c0bb43cbe98c25c0a652b2-952x640.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2Fce57bd4cba8930dc71c0bb43cbe98c25c0a652b2-952x640.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fybdv5za2%2Fproduction%2Fce57bd4cba8930dc71c0bb43cbe98c25c0a652b2-952x640.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fc